// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// RC3-INC4 — INSTITUTIONAL POLISH PASSES (PURE GEOMETRY). These act ONLY on the drawn
// vertex set / SVG path. They NEVER touch the canonical series, visiblePoints,
